source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A trailing lone backslash has no character to escape, so Jira keeps it and it blocks the pair; jiro reads all three backslashes as literal text.
-- input.jira --
a\\b\
-- rendered.html --
<p>a\\b\</p>
-- want.md --
a\\\\b\\
-- warnings.json --
[]
